Night is Coming - Wrath of the Woods is already here!

This is the free trial of Night is Coming. Based on and offering the same experience as the previously released demo, it allows players to once again face the dread of encroaching Darkness and struggle for survival in an unforgiving fantasy world. If you missed the demo or want to once again get immersed in the grim realm of Night is Coming, this version provides a chance to try the game at any time!

Lead your own settlement in a harsh universe inspired by Slavic mythology: develop and upgrade your town, take care of its inhabitants, and prepare for the imminent arrival of the forces of Darkness!

There's a lot to discover in Night is Coming - Wrath of the Woods:
 single-biome procedurally generated map;
 seasons changing between spring and summer;
 day and night cycle;
 various weather conditions;
 numerous random events;
 dynamic combat and magic systems;
 settlement construction and defense;
 regular enemies and mini-bosses with their own lairs;
 settler management;
 tech tree with development points and village upgrades.
Remember:
 Once every few days, the Blood Moon shall arrive, during which the forest dwellers will try their darndest to destroy you;
 The more you develop, the more furious the evil forces will grow, bringing forth more dangerous monsters;
 Your Bestiary will be filled with records about defeated foe: look into it for fascinating and useful information;
 Don't forget to explore the surrounding forest — curiosity will be rewarded with powerful blessings and more!
The content available in the game is enough to keep one engaged for over an hour but, of course, this is just a glimpse of what awaits you in the full release.

🔥 Moreover, we have important news — an official launch date has been set!

🔥 Night is Coming will release in Early Access on April 14!

