Greetings, Settlers!

Right now, you have an opportunity to be among the first to play our upcoming title, as we are happy to announce the launch of its public playtest! Simply go to the project's page on Steam and click the green "Request Access" button, which shall be granted immediately, and you will be able to download the game.

Lead your own settlement in a harsh world inspired by Slavic mythology: develop and upgrade it, take care of the inhabitants, and prepare to repel the forces of Darkness!

What awaits you during the playtest:
 single-biome procedurally generated map;
 seasons changing between spring and summer;
 day and night cycle;
 various weather conditions;
 numerous random events;
 dynamic combat and magic systems;
 settlement construction and defense;
 regular enemies and mini-bosses with their own lairs;
 settler management;
 tech tree with development points and village improvements.
We believe that the content available during the playtest will be enough to captivate players for more than an hour. And this, of course, is only a portion of what awaits you in the full release.

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/34559962/14bc7a20271f93aeacfe6aa2c448e16fa9d1e902.png

We would also be grateful if you could leave a review in the feedback form , which can be accessed from within the game itself. This would greatly help us make the final version even better and more engaging!

❗ If you enjoyed the game, please add Night is Coming to your wishlist and subscribe to stay up-to-date with future news and be notified of the game's eventual release!

